WEBVTT

00:03:29.692 --> 00:03:30.935
don't make sense.

00:03:30.959 --> 00:03:33.308
We need systems
that work with our creativity

00:03:33.332 --> 00:03:34.634
and not against it.

00:03:34.658 --> 00:03:35.888
[SO HOW DO WE FIX IT?]

00:03:35.912 --> 00:03:38.228
There is no quick fix for this problem.

00:03:38.252 --> 00:03:39.958
And I know, I know, that sucks.

00:03:39.982 --> 00:03:42.778
No one loves a good framework
or a good acronym

00:03:42.802 --> 00:03:43.961
better than me.

00:03:43.985 --> 00:03:47.048
But the truth is everyone
has their own narratives

00:03:47.072 --> 00:03:48.418
that they have to uncover.

00:03:48.442 --> 00:03:51.748
It wasn't until I started digging
around my own beliefs around work

00:03:51.772 --> 00:03:55.314
that I began to unravel
the root of my own work story,

00:03:55.338 --> 00:03:58.278
finally being able to let go
of destructive behaviors

00:03:58.302 --> 00:04:00.818
and make positive, long-lasting changes.